    "detailed_description": "Traveling throughout the mysterious Beia Galaxy, weary Explorers finally find solace in the starry sky\u2014a blue planet shining brightly, just like a long-lost home.<br>Step out of your Lander, my friend. You've landed on an uncharted planet. Now it's time to make it your home! <br>Can you harness this azure planet's resources and transform this wild territory into a thriving community?<br>The challenge is great, but the space brims with opportunities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/637cd144c63f24e5d3d575c016f254eb.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/637cd144c63f24e5d3d575c016f254eb.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/637cd144c63f24e5d3d575c016f254eb.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Master the land: Fell trees and mine resources to build everything you can imagine, from castles to gardens. Your dream life is just in your hands.<br><br>Live with yourself: Engage in farming and fishing, reap as you sow, and prepare meals from harvests. Your dedication will always be rewarded.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/a17353bc9ae4626bdca8dde08d48c254.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/a17353bc9ae4626bdca8dde08d48c254.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/a17353bc9ae4626bdca8dde08d48c254.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Social events: Immerse yourself in grand parties and epic festivals. Let's construct our dream haven together. The more, the merrier!<br><br>Develop survival skills: Catch exotic pets and tame mounts to give you a hand. Explore and solve puzzles, showcase your skills, and strategize to fight the wild Lords together. You will grow with every task you undertake.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/2bf1eebff34e7505c81df3514d70a9a6.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/2bf1eebff34e7505c81df3514d70a9a6.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/2bf1eebff34e7505c81df3514d70a9a6.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience nature: From grasslands and rainforests to icefields and deserts, come to enjoy the breathtaking landscapes and embrace the wonders of nature.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/4e1545cca6dfc8e44f367deb94eeab08.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/4e1545cca6dfc8e44f367deb94eeab08.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/4e1545cca6dfc8e44f367deb94eeab08.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Push the frontiers of technology: Dive into R&amp;D, build rockets, and venture into space to uncover the vastness and secrets of the universe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/e441b3cf00647f9c265ff2386cf46de8.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/e441b3cf00647f9c265ff2386cf46de8.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/e441b3cf00647f9c265ff2386cf46de8.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on an extraordinary journey in Auroria and throw yourself into a world where imagination knows no bounds. Join forces with friends, craft your own destiny, and unravel the mysteries of this captivating celestial realm. The stars await your arrival\u2014 Let the adventure begin!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/357c4b082378ba2c53ad0382e543bdcf.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/357c4b082378ba2c53ad0382e543bdcf.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/357c4b082378ba2c53ad0382e543bdcf.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Traveling throughout the mysterious Beia Galaxy, weary Explorers finally find solace in the starry sky\u2014a blue planet shining brightly, just like a long-lost home.<br>Step out of your Lander, my friend. You've landed on an uncharted planet. Now it's time to make it your home! <br>Can you harness this azure planet's resources and transform this wild territory into a thriving community?<br>The challenge is great, but the space brims with opportunities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/637cd144c63f24e5d3d575c016f254eb.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/637cd144c63f24e5d3d575c016f254eb.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/637cd144c63f24e5d3d575c016f254eb.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Master the land: Fell trees and mine resources to build everything you can imagine, from castles to gardens. Your dream life is just in your hands.<br><br>Live with yourself: Engage in farming and fishing, reap as you sow, and prepare meals from harvests. Your dedication will always be rewarded.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/a17353bc9ae4626bdca8dde08d48c254.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/a17353bc9ae4626bdca8dde08d48c254.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/a17353bc9ae4626bdca8dde08d48c254.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Social events: Immerse yourself in grand parties and epic festivals. Let's construct our dream haven together. The more, the merrier!<br><br>Develop survival skills: Catch exotic pets and tame mounts to give you a hand. Explore and solve puzzles, showcase your skills, and strategize to fight the wild Lords together. You will grow with every task you undertake.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/2bf1eebff34e7505c81df3514d70a9a6.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/2bf1eebff34e7505c81df3514d70a9a6.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/2bf1eebff34e7505c81df3514d70a9a6.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience nature: From grasslands and rainforests to icefields and deserts, come to enjoy the breathtaking landscapes and embrace the wonders of nature.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/4e1545cca6dfc8e44f367deb94eeab08.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/4e1545cca6dfc8e44f367deb94eeab08.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/4e1545cca6dfc8e44f367deb94eeab08.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Push the frontiers of technology: Dive into R&amp;D, build rockets, and venture into space to uncover the vastness and secrets of the universe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/e441b3cf00647f9c265ff2386cf46de8.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/e441b3cf00647f9c265ff2386cf46de8.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/e441b3cf00647f9c265ff2386cf46de8.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on an extraordinary journey in Auroria and throw yourself into a world where imagination knows no bounds. Join forces with friends, craft your own destiny, and unravel the mysteries of this captivating celestial realm. The stars await your arrival\u2014 Let the adventure begin!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/357c4b082378ba2c53ad0382e543bdcf.poster.avif?t=1701078013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/357c4b082378ba2c53ad0382e543bdcf.webm?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564450/extras/357c4b082378ba2c53ad0382e543bdcf.mp4?t=1701078013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
